   "url": "https://dev.to/code_2/i-built-a-chatgpt-clone-using-nextjs-openai-api-heres-what-happened-9i8",
   "domain": "dev.to",
   "snippet": "April 15, 2025 - Next.js 15 (App Router): For server/client rendering and routing. TailwindCSS: For quick and responsive UI styling. OpenAI API: For chat capabilities. TypeScript: For type safety and better dev experience. React Hooks (useState, useEffect): To manage messages. /chatgpt-clone \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 app/ \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 page.tsx --> Main chat page \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 api/ \u2502 \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 chat/route.ts --> API route to OpenAI \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500"
